$Name: Nightjar Cell - Hit and Fade
$Type: single
+Description:
 XSTR("Nightjar is a black ops squadron: a handful of pilots in assault Vipers and a hidden tanker, cut off from the fleet and off every roster. No battlestar, no reinforcements: ambushes, raids and evacuations against an enemy that has no idea where they are. Ten missions.", -1)
